window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-010-222627a6e5b9bab8.json"]={sha256:"222627a6e5b9bab85dadddeab0669b9649e9bb0924823b7f0616fab2ed3c78e9",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-685e5922e4ab6e98","url":"https://www.fz-juelich.de/en/jsc/jupiter/tech/","title":"JUPITER technical overview","titleEn":"JUPITER technical overview","publisher":"Jülich Supercomputing Centre","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-010","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-010","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-011","referenceUrls":["https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/numa_memory_policy.html"],"title":"Linux NUMA：cpuset 與記憶體政策的交集","titleEn":"Linux NUMA: intersecting cpusets with memory policy","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付兩段服務帳本、五分鐘事件表、瓶頸轉移圖與重試造成雙重計數的反例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both service ledgers, the five-minute event trace, a bottleneck-migration explanation and a retry double-counting counterexample. State why module capacity and completed scientific work are different metrics. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸出 requested、allowed、effective 三集合與 excluded_reason；已配置頁面另列，不自動套用新的集合。","differenceEn":"Emit requested, allowed and effective sets with an exclusion reason for every rejected node. Keep existing page placement in a separate table; changing the policy record must not silently relocate those pages.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["無丟棄且每件工作各經兩服務一次時，穩態輸出率上限為兩服務率的最小值；此式不含啟動延遲或批次填充；前處理固定每分鐘 10 件；加速服務由每分鐘 6 件提升為 12 件；每件工作大小與驗證條件相同；名義式 min(10,6) = 6 items/min；變更式 min(10,12) = 10 items/min。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","對本課明定的非空 bind 集合，候選節點取政策與允許集合交集；容量再對交集求和。空交集需單獨處理，不能推定任何核心版本的 fallback；政策集合 {0,1,2}；名義允許 {1,2,3}，變更 {2,3}；各候選節點可用容量皆為 64 GiB；名義式 2*64 = 128 GiB；變更式 1*64 = 64 GiB。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With no drops and one visit to each stage per item, the steady-state output ceiling is the smaller service rate. This bound excludes pipeline startup, batching, finite buffers and additional revisits. The synthetic preprocessing stage serves 10 items per minute. Accelerator service rises from 6 to 12 items per minute, with unchanged item size and validation requirements. All rates are teaching assumptions. Nominal min(10,6) = 6 items/min; changed min(10,12) = 10 items/min. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For this fixture’s nonempty bind intersection, eligible nodes are those permitted by both sets. Sum their available capacities; treat an empty intersection separately rather than inventing version-independent kernel fallback semantics. Set requested nodes to {0,1,2}. Allowed nodes change from {1,2,3} to {2,3}; each eligible node has 64 GiB of available capacity. All capacities are synthetic snapshots, not reserved guarantees. Nominal 2*64 = 128 GiB; changed 1*64 = 64 GiB. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-020","referenceUrls":["https://kernel.org/doc/html/latest/kernel-hacking/false-sharing.html"],"title":"Linux false sharing：寫入序列的擁有權轉移","titleEn":"Linux false sharing: ownership transitions in a write trace","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付兩段服務帳本、五分鐘事件表、瓶頸轉移圖與重試造成雙重計數的反例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both service ledgers, the five-minute event trace, a bottleneck-migration explanation and a retry double-counting counterexample. State why module capacity and completed scientific work are different metrics. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸入 writer_core、counter_id、address 與序號；以教學 64-byte 線切分地址，依每線維護前一個 writer。","differenceEn":"Input writer_core, counter_id, address and sequence number. Map addresses to synthetic 64-byte lines and retain the previous writer separately for each line; do not compare writers across unrelated lines.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["無丟棄且每件工作各經兩服務一次時，穩態輸出率上限為兩服務率的最小值；此式不含啟動延遲或批次填充；前處理固定每分鐘 10 件；加速服務由每分鐘 6 件提升為 12 件；每件工作大小與驗證條件相同；名義式 min(10,6) = 6 items/min；變更式 min(10,12) = 10 items/min。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","簡化模型中，同一線的連續寫入若換了核心便計一次擁有權轉移；初次取得不計，模型不含協定細節與寫入合併；八個核心輪流各寫一次，重複一千輪，共 8000 次；名義八計數器同線，變更每核心一條獨立線；名義式 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions；變更式 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With no drops and one visit to each stage per item, the steady-state output ceiling is the smaller service rate. This bound excludes pipeline startup, batching, finite buffers and additional revisits. The synthetic preprocessing stage serves 10 items per minute. Accelerator service rises from 6 to 12 items per minute, with unchanged item size and validation requirements. All rates are teaching assumptions. Nominal min(10,6) = 6 items/min; changed min(10,12) = 10 items/min. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","In the simplified model, successive writes to the same line count one ownership transition when the writer core changes. Initial acquisition is excluded, as are coherence protocol details and write combining. Eight cores write in round-robin order for one thousand rounds, totaling 8000 writes. Initially all counters share one line; after padding, each core owns a separate line with the same update sequence. Nominal 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions; changed 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-d2695308610b7d71","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/numa_memory_policy.html","title":"NUMA Memory Policy","titleEn":"NUMA Memory Policy","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-d78e76d901c6709c","url":"https://kernel.org/doc/html/latest/kernel-hacking/false-sharing.html","title":"False Sharing","titleEn":"False Sharing","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
